    {
      "id": "yozyspp",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2. Article 12–13: Definition and Protection"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "toz4eah",
      "content": "• Article 12 defines the term 'State'. It includes Government, Parliament, State Legislatures, local authorities and other authorities."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "y4skj3o",
      "content": "• Article 13 declares that laws inconsistent with Fundamental Rights are void."
    },
    {
      "id": "uqx1eqj",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. Right to Equality (Articles 14–18)"
    },
    {
      "id": "ctbm7v7",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
