            "<p>Abolition of titles</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3c8k9t5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Exceptions to Right to Equality"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "o4zy46a",
      "content": "• President and Governors enjoy immunity from court proceedings during their tenure."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "elboess",
      "content": "• Parliament can make special provisions for women and children."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9cmed06",
      "content": "• State can provide reservations for SC, ST and OBC."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "svfwypc",
      "content": "• Diplomatic officials enjoy immunity."
    },
    {
      "id": "oa4eyh4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Right to Freedom (Articles 19–22)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0l7khe5",
      "content": "Article 19 provides six freedoms to citizens:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ds1ofxv",
      "content": "• Freedom of speech and expression"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "o8jo6lo",
      "content": "• Freedom to assemble peacefully"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "az07w77",
      "content": "• Freedom to form associations or unions"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zrhpdva",
      "content": "• Freedom to move freely throughout India"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cweh0i1",
      "content": "• Freedom to reside and settle in any part of India"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ae7m6hb",
      "content": "• Freedom to practice any profession or occupation"
    },
    {
      "id": "cnf3cwf",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Reasonable Restrictions"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "a3fahw0",
      "content": "• Security of the state"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "9gm65si",
      "content": "• Public order"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "40nknxp",
      "content": "• Morality"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9coiyjk",
      "content": "• Friendly relations with foreign states"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "hll4rcg",
      "content": "• Contempt of court"
    },
